      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_14",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("We have arrived. This is a long-abandoned sanctum that you may know as the lair of the mage Iliah-Malal."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("It is here that I seek Iliah-Malal’s Amulet of the Veil, an artifact possessing the power to open gates between the land of the living and that of the dead. I once thought such a power too dangerous to use; I am no longer so naive."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("Iliah-Malal? I know that name from the histories..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 2000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("All this time... all this time I thought we were questing towards a noble goal. Searching for a legendary sword, an ancient tome, a holy relic."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("Instead, our quest brings us to the lair of a necromancer?! How can you possibly mean to make use of anything ever possessed by such an evil? As soldiers of Wesnoth we are honor-bound to fight for the Light, not the darkness!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("Do not be so shortsighted. With the power to open portals to the Land of the Dead, I can pull Mal-Ravanal’s spirit out of this world. Then, the spells granting false life to the dead will fail, and their fearsome armies will collapse into piles of bones. I am wielding this power for the good of Irdya, not for your honor’s sake."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("Dacyn, I am uneasy about this course of action. I know little of the Land of the Dead, but everything I have heard suggests-"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("You would violate the dead’s eternal peace to fight a war, yet you call me shortsighted?! And while our homeland bleeds, you have the gall to speak of the good of all life?! Madness! As a mage of the Light, you should know better!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("I have had enough of your second-guessing. You, fool of a horse boy, know nothing of the mystic arts, yet you mask your ignorance by cowering behind a pretend morality. If that is what you insist on doing, then by all means return to Wesnoth and add your corpses to Mal-Ravanal’s ever-growing hordes."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("Unlike you, I have the knowledge and power to defeat the undead, and I intend to use it to destroy Mal-Ravanal. Will you wallow in your shortsightedness, or do you intend to help me safeguard all that lives?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 2000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("I will help you. We have come this far, and it seems a waste to turn back now."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("By the Clans, I will not!! Would that I had perished in battle against the undead! Better that than living to see Wesnoth’s high mage succumb to the temptation of darkness."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("Gweddry, if you truly wish to aid this madman, I will guard the outer gates for you. But I will not enter that evil stronghold. I would sooner perish than travel one step closer towards Dacyn’s foul amulet."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_15",
        on: "turn",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_side",
            equals: 1,
          },
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "turn_number",
            equals: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("Ah, I still remember this place quite clearly. Now that I think of it, Ravan had always been very interested in the magic of darkness. Apparently, the balance between light and dark would be crucial to the safety of Irdya in the future, at least according to Ravan’s theory. In hindsight, that was all nonsense."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("The irony seems lost on you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("Back then this place was full of traps and undead, and it will no doubt be worse now that the wild beasts have had a chance to move in."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Dacyn",
            x: 35,
            y: 17,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Dacyn",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "nw",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("Ravan sealed this place before our last meeting. I need a moment to remember the incantation."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("The red star blazes, The red stone bleeds. The black pool swallows all voices, The darkness between worlds opens its maw."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "gate-fall.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
