      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_107",
        on: "die",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Sanctum%20Guard%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Sanctum Guard",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22kill%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22side%22%3A%224%22%2C%22animate%22%3A%22yes%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_location%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22x%22%3A%2212%22%2C%22y%22%3A%224%22%2C%22radius%22%3A%227%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_music",
            file: "silence.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("Excellent. Now..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Dacyn",
            x: 12,
            y: 4,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("Wait, Dacyn, before you pick that up... are you sure this is the right decision? Even if you can wield it safely, something this evil will doubtlessly corrupt anyone who possesses it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("Why, I’m incredibly touched by your deep show of affection. I’m sure that will be of great comfort when thousands are massacred after Wesnoth loses its greatest war in living memory."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 2000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("No, Gweddry, I am not sure. But I know of no other way to defeat Mal-Ravanal. I have tried once before. Even as a mage, Ravan’s powers near outmatched my own. As the lich Mal-Ravanal, perhaps only Delfador the Great could have stood a chance."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("This Amulet will give us the edge that I need. With it, I can open a gate to the Land of the Dead and pull Mal-Ravanal’s unholy spells out of this world."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("But if what you said is true, the very same could be said of Ravan. How do you know you will not fall down the same path as well?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 2000,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("You are right, Gweddry. I cannot know. But I must try. If I do not, Wesnoth — nay, all of Irdya — will surely fall to ruin. As long as I try, there is still a chance. Sacrificing myself is of no consequence if it is for the greater good."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("(picks up the amulet)"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:remove_item",
            x: 13,
            y: 5,
            item_name: "",
            image: "",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:add_item",
            x: 13,
            y: 5,
            item_name: "",
            image: "items%2Faltar-evil.png",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "magic-dark-big-miss.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 100,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 100,
          },
