          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Chief Dra-Nak",
            text: _("Hah, did you think you were safe hiding back in here? Nobody can escape from Dra-Nak, greatest chief east of the Listra."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Cowardly Goblin",
            text: _("See see! I told you there were humans in here! And I showed you the secret passage! Reward reward?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Chief Dra-Nak",
            text: _("Sure, here you go. You did well."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "gold.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Cowardly Goblin",
            x: 0,
            y: 12,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Chief Dra-Nak",
            text: _("As for you humans, you might as well convince your friends outside to surrender. Otherwise, we’ll slaughter you all starting with that injured old man. I gave you a chance to do things fairly before, but now we’re doing things my way."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("<span size='small'><i>_ I don’t know what these orcs want with us, but we can’t hope to escape with Dacyn so badly hurt.</i></span>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("Very well, orc, we will surrender."),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
